jcc-check-fuse-rip | xtask/src/jcc.rs | lit:(first.ops.contains('$') && first.ops.contains('(')) ==> false | cargo test -p xtask --bin xtask jcc:: | msg:fused_pair_counts_from_the_compare.*FAILED|immediate \+ memory does not fuse
